Template-Type: ReDIF-Article 1.0
Author-Name: Armaan Sehgal
Title: Research Note Short Communication RemitDubai - An Easier way for Migrant Laborers in the UAE to Compare Exchange Rates
Abstract: Migrant workers form the core of the Gulf states, especially the UAE with the rapid development of the desert. Although migrant workers include all forms of the working class, the main goal of the labour class is to send money back to their family. These migrant labourers must go through exchange houses that may have steep fees showcased or already included in the exchange rates used. Hence, the goal of RemitDubai was to build a site that discloses the variety in exchange rates, since when transferring large amounts of money senders would benefit from services that offer the best value.
